    "detailed_description": "Fearless is a single-player , third-person , zombie shooter that plunges you into a harrowing mission to save your sister from a zombie-infested island. Navigate a dark, stormy environment where every shadow hides danger, and every sound sends chills down your spine!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883020/extras/42abe8e0f2573e7e1f3add3177ec4d23.avif?t=1747885280\" width=500 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Shooting &amp; Puzzle solving :</strong>Engage in intense shooting action as you fend off hordes of zombies, while also using your wits to solve clever puzzles scattered throughout the island. Balance combat encounters with brain-teasing challenges for a dynamic gameplay experience.<br></li><li><strong>Zombie shooting action :</strong>Eliminate hordes of zombies in a third-person perspective .<br></li><li><strong>Tense Atmosphere :</strong>Feel the tension rise as you navigate through dark and eerie environments, with limited resources and the constant threat of zombie attacks keeping you on edge at all times.<br></li><li><strong>Resource Management:</strong>Use your ammunition wisely &amp; keep your flashlight powered up to illuminate dark areas and uncover hidden stuff, but be mindful of battery usage as you explore the island's dark and treacherous environments.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Fearless is a single-player , third-person , zombie shooter that plunges you into a harrowing mission to save your sister from a zombie-infested island. Navigate a dark, stormy environment where every shadow hides danger, and every sound sends chills down your spine!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2883020/extras/42abe8e0f2573e7e1f3add3177ec4d23.avif?t=1747885280\" width=500 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Shooting &amp; Puzzle solving :</strong>Engage in intense shooting action as you fend off hordes of zombies, while also using your wits to solve clever puzzles scattered throughout the island. Balance combat encounters with brain-teasing challenges for a dynamic gameplay experience.<br></li><li><strong>Zombie shooting action :</strong>Eliminate hordes of zombies in a third-person perspective .<br></li><li><strong>Tense Atmosphere :</strong>Feel the tension rise as you navigate through dark and eerie environments, with limited resources and the constant threat of zombie attacks keeping you on edge at all times.<br></li><li><strong>Resource Management:</strong>Use your ammunition wisely &amp; keep your flashlight powered up to illuminate dark areas and uncover hidden stuff, but be mindful of battery usage as you explore the island's dark and treacherous environments.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Dive into Fearless, a thrilling single-player zombie shooter. Navigate through an island overrun by the undead to rescue your sister. Are you &quot;Fearless&quot; enough to face the hordes and emerge victorious? Embark on the adventure today!",
